OL,3,GNEWSAAlliance will engage 'without
OL,4,Aprejudice' on Irish unity - Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlliance leader Naomi Long has said
OL,7,Fthat her party will "engage
OL,8,Frespectfully" in any conversations
OL,9,Fabout Northern Ireland's future.
OL,11,FIt comes after the tanaiste (Irish
OL,12,Fdeputy prime minister) Simon Harris
OL,13,Fasked some political parties in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland, including unionists,
OL,15,Ffor feedback on Fine Gael's so-called
OL,16,F"blueprint" on Irish unity.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
