OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAlliance will engage 'without
OL,4,Aprejudice' on Irish unity - Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ulster Unionist leader, Jon
OL,7,FBurrows, called the plans "political
OL,8,Fsuicide". Democratic Unionist Party
OL,9,F(DUP) leader Gavin Robinson called it a
OL,10,F"crass attempt to outbid Fine Gael's
OL,11,Frivals in Dublin".
OL,13,FLong said Alliance would take part
OL,14,F"without prejudice to how we might
OL,15,Fdecide the constitutional question".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
